                  "summary": "Comprehensive interview-grade breakdown of **Maximum sum subarray** under **Sliding Window** (DSA). Covers core intuition, mathematical/algorithmic analysis, trade-offs, and critical edge cases for Tier-1 Tech (FAANG / Product MNCs) interviews.",
